    /// <summary>
    /// Minimal runtime terrain view for Cossacks 2 .m3d maps.
    /// Old surface path: 3DMP + ZSPM + SURF (retail maps).
    /// New surface path: 3DMP + HSEM.
    /// Renders only terrain heights + bounds, no textures.
    /// </summary>
